gpui_windows: Apply and report background appearance

The backdrop helpers called RtlGetVersion with a zeroed structure, whose
size field must be set, and dropped every failure, so a backdrop could
silently not apply. Set the size, return whether the Windows build
supports the attribute, and log a failure from set_background_appearance.
An ignored test checks the helpers against a real window on Windows 11.

Newport needs it for Remote apps on Windows: menus and tooltips open with
a transparent background.

Adds no trait methods.

Remove when upstream gpui_windows reports background appearance failures.

